DMVPN PHASE 3 - VERIFICATION GUIDE
==================================

1. UNDERLAY CONNECTIVITY
------------------------
Verify physical network reachability:

ping 10.0.100.1
ping 10.0.100.2
ping 10.0.100.3
ping 10.0.100.4
ping 10.0.100.5

Expected:
All routers must be reachable over underlay network.

---

2. TUNNEL STATUS
----------------
show ip interface brief

Expected:
Tunnel0 on all routers should be UP/UP

---

3. NHRP TABLE
-------------
show ip nhrp

Expected:
- Hub entries (R1, R2) visible as NHS
- Spoke entries dynamic
- NBMA (underlay IPs) mapped correctly

---

4. DMVPN STATUS
---------------
show dmvpn

Expected:
- All spokes registered
- Multiple NHS entries visible
- NBMA peer addresses learned

---

5. SPOKE-TO-SPOKE TEST
----------------------
From any spoke:

ping 172.16.100.X

Expected behavior:
- First packet may go via hub
- Subsequent traffic uses direct tunnel
- Spoke-to-spoke shortcut is formed

---

6. HUB FAILOVER TEST
--------------------
Step 1:
Shutdown R1 interface

Step 2:
Verify failover:

show ip nhrp
show dmvpn

Expected:
- R2 becomes active hub
- Spokes re-register automatically
- No manual intervention required

---

7. FINAL VALIDATION
-------------------
All conditions must be true:

- Tunnel UP/UP
- NHRP tables populated
- DMVPN peers visible
- Spoke-to-spoke connectivity working
- Hub failover successful
